Variable Number_that_will_die
Title: Number that will eventually die, US
Description: The current numbers for total deaths in the US lifted left by 14 days to approximate the number of people who already have COVID-19 and have either already died from it or will eventually die from it.  This is based only on the current trend, but is perhaps a better depiction of the actual current situation on a given date.
Definition: LocalIndex T / "Time1" := CopyIndex(Time) - 14;~
Compare3[Time=T+14]
