Chance OGD_SolidBandExample
Title: Solid band example
Description: This node contains two demonstrations.~
~
The first demonstration is of filling between bands in a probability bands plot.   This one displays when you view the Bands view.  The code for creating this plot is in the Else case in the OnGraphDraw attribute.~
~
The second demonstration is filling a band when you provide a lower and upper bound for the band. For example, you might want to indicate an expected range for data behind the actual plot of your data. This example displays when you view the Mid on Sample views. The code for displaying this band appears in the Then clause in the OnGraphDraw attribute.~
~
Both of these shoud be drawn in the "after axes, before data" stage (so they draw in front of the grid lines). Plot_solid_band needs "before drawing" if you want it to adjust the Y-axis autoscale range to include the bounds.
Definition: If IsSampleEvalMode Then ~
	100 * CumProduct( 1+Normal(0,8%,over:OGD_Time_step), OGD_Time_step)~
Else~
	100 * CumProduct( 1+Random(Normal(0,8%,over:OGD_Time_step)), OGD_Time_step)
