Function OGD_SubstRoleValues(roles : [GraphingRole, GraphFillerInfo]; pattern : text atom ; caller : handle atom)
Description: To be used from within OnGraphDraw attribute. Uses a pattern to identify which role values are to be used to form labels.  ~
~
«roles» is the role variable supplied to OnGraphDraw.~
~
«pattern» is text that contains substitution patterns of the form "<Y axis>", "<X axis>", etc, where the recognized pattern names are the role names in GraphingRoles. When a pattern name appears, the role value is substituted for the template. If the role is unpopulated, uses the empty text.~
~
«numFmtObj» is a handle to the object whose number format is to be used to format the values as text.
Definition: Local labels := pattern;~
Local role[] := GraphingRole Do (~
	if FindInText("<"&role&">", pattern) then (~
		Local rRoleVal := roles[GraphingRole=role,GraphFillerInfo='Value'];~
		Local roleSrc := roles[GraphingRole=role,GraphFillerInfo='Source'];~
		Local roleVal:=If IsReference(rRoleVal) Then #rRoleVal else "";~
		Local numFmt := If IsHandle(roleSrc) Then roleSrc else caller;~
		Local roleValText := NumberToText( roleVal, getFrom: numFmt);~
		labels := TextReplace(labels, "<"&role&">", roleValText, all:true, caseInsensitive:false);~
	)~
);~
labels
