Description: Select the rate at which deaths are expected to decay while suppression measures are active. This should be a value between 0 (no decay) and -0.1 (measures as effective as those in China). A more negative value means stronger measures leading to a shorter amount of time in the suppression phase. ~
~
The units are Ln(deaths)/day
Definition: Choice(Self,2)
