Module Running_forecast
Title: Running forecast
Description: In the article <a href="https://lumina.com/estimating-us-deaths-from-covid-19-coronavirus-in-2020/">Estimating US Deaths from COVID-19 Coronavirus in 2020</a> on 10-Mar-2020 I published a probabilistic forecast, then updated it two weeks later on 23-Mar-2020 in the article <a href="https://lumina.com/forecast-update-us-deaths-from-covid-19-coronavirus-in-2020/">Suppression strategy and update forecast for US deaths from COVID-19 Coronavirus in 2020</a>. This module contains my Keelin encodings of these running forecasts.  This isn't part of the suppression model, but I've left it here anyway.
Author: Lonnie Chrisman, Ph.D.~
Lumina Decision Systems
